  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large clay or ceramic dish over medium heat. Add the onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic, ginger, cumin, coriander, cinnamon, and red pepper flakes to the dish. Cook for 1-2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the chicken to the dish and cook until browned on all sides, about 5-7 minutes.",
    "Add the chicken broth, broth, honey, and lemon juice to the dish. Stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then cover the dish and transfer it to the oven.",
    "Bake for 25-30 minutes, or until the chicken is cooked through and the sauce has thickened.",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley and serve hot over couscous or rice."
